#var, use command >Rest Client: Switch Environment in search bar of vs code
@id =1

###

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": {
    "email": "example@example.com",
    "isVerified": true
  },
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Perez",
  "role": "USER",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "phoneNumbers": [
    {
      "number": "123456789",
      "isPrimary": true
    }
  ]
}

###

